### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 1. 회원가입 (이메일 인증 전 임시 저장)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup/local
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-API-Version: 1.0.0

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "nickname": "테스터"
}

### 2. 이메일 인증 코드 확인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify/email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-API-Version: 1.0.0

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 3. 이메일 인증 코드 재전송
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/verify/email/resend
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-API-Version: 1.0.0

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 4. 로그인 (accessToken 반환)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login/local
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-API-Version: 1.0.0

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 5. 액세스 토큰 갱신 (refreshToken 쿠키 필요)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-API-Version: 1.0.0
Cookie: refreshToken=<paste-refresh-token-here>

### 6. 로그아웃
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
X-API-Version: 1.0.0
Cookie: refreshToken=<paste-refresh-token-here>
